Phrasal verbs occupy a huge place in the English language. They make speech bright and varied, therefore they are constantly used in colloquial English speech.

This application is an offline tool to study, practice and learn phrasal verbs in an easy way. With this application, you will understand how to use and memorize phrasal verbs correctly. You will be able to make phrasal verbs that will help you express your thoughts and describe actions very accurately.

While learning English phrasal verbs, you will test your knowledge by taking tests in which you are asked to choose the correct phrasal verb or part of it. Upon completion of the test, the application shows you the result.

We have collected for you:
- the most necessary phrasal verbs;
- list of phrasal verbs in alphabetical order;
- examples of use in speech;
- lessons and tests to test knowledge;
- evaluation of your result;
- free and does not require internet

We offer you to start studying the list of English phrasal verbs right now, which will help you out in any life situation and make your speech more beautiful and natural.

We wish you good luck in learning English!

If you enjoy the app, please leave us a review. It means a lot!
